{"unit_id":"taxueseek__argo#card-zh","repo":"taxueseek/argo","commit":"3b27a587c3aaf35c0ea38b29948ec8ee59de18fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Argo 阿尔戈（DSH 网页客户端插件）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供联网搜索、网页抓取和资料研究。插件注册 argo_search、argo_fetch 原生工具及 web_search/web_fetch provider，也可按需挂载完整 MCP 工具集。主要功能包括多源与本机搜索、网页正文抓取、来源证据评估和 wide_research 并行编排。适合需要在 DSH 对话中查资料、核验来源或生成研究报告的用户。需 Node.js 18+、Python 3.9+ 与 PyYAML；API 密钥按需配置，免密引擎可直接使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/dsh/index.js:395","packages/dsh-plugin/dsh/index.js:467","packages/dsh-plugin/dsh/index.js:483","bin/argo.js:70"]}
{"unit_id":"taxueseek__argo#card-en","repo":"taxueseek/argo","commit":"3b27a587c3aaf35c0ea38b29948ec8ee59de18fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Argo is a DSH web plugin for search, page fetching, and parallel research. It registers native tools, web providers, and optional MCP tools. Search local files, check sources, and create research reports. Requires Node.js 18+, Python 3.9+, and PyYAML; API keys are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-plugin/dsh/index.js:395","packages/dsh-plugin/dsh/index.js:467","packages/dsh-plugin/dsh/index.js:483","bin/argo.js:70"]}
